WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.600
Have you ever wondered about the secret desire
of SCP-451, Mister Lonely?

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.800
Foundation staff used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-451 while

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.690
he was weeping in the Site-19 cafeteria.

00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:15.549
This was the result:

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:20.970
"SCP-451 lies awake in a bunk in the Site-19
sleeping quarters, surrounded by other staff

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:21.970
members.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:25.500
SCP-451 exhibits a look of relief on his face."

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.400
Just once, SCP-451 wants to feel that he is
not completely alone.

